   "source": [
    "# ML Intraday V3 \u2014 Enhanced Pipeline Runner\n",
    "Runs and inspects the **ml_intraday_v3** pipeline stages with **comprehensive statistics** and **Monte Carlo simulation**.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Enhancements:**\n",
    "- Automatic stats printing after each stage\n",
    "- Monte Carlo simulation for robustness testing\n",
    "- Trade sequence randomization tests\n",
    "- Bootstrap confidence intervals\n",
    "\n",
    "**Assumptions**\n",
    "- Run from the repo root (contains `ml_intraday_v3/`).\n",
    "- Virtual env is activated and deps installed.\n",
    "- `ml_intraday_v3/configs/data.yaml` points to your raw data."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 0) Parameters & Imports"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
